Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:29:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(nodes): clients of each fuse set for the node detail
 (F-29)

GET /nodes/:name/fuse-sets returns every fuse set of a node with its
client_count (null when Colbits has not recorded it), single set first and
then by branch letter. It applies the user scope like GET /nodes, and a node
outside the scope gives the same 404 as a node that does not exist.

