+# AI log — SCRUM-180 (US11 · F-29 clients of each fuse set) — 2026-10-25
+
+**Author:** Yeison Delgado · **Tool:** Claude (Claude Code)
+
+## What the AI generated
+- `GET /nodes/:name/fuse-sets` in `backend/src/nodes/nodes.controller.ts`, with Swagger docs.
+- `NodesService.fuseSetsOf()` and `NODE_FUSE_SETS_SQL` in `backend/src/nodes/nodes.service.ts`;
+  `FuseSetViewDto` and `NodeFuseSetsResponseDto` in `dto/nodes.dto.ts`.
+- Unit tests `nodes.fuse-sets.spec.ts`, new cases in `nodes.controller.spec.ts`, and the e2e test
+  `backend/test/fuse-sets.e2e-spec.ts`.
+
+## What I did / reviewed
+- Checked the requirement against Scope v6.0 (US11, F-29) and Colbits' schema: the value is
+  `fuses_sets.client_count`, which can be NULL, so the API keeps `null` ("not recorded") instead of 0.
